                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR VERARBEITUNG EINER BASISDIENSTSATZFARBE UND COMPUTERSPEICHERMEDIUM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE TRAITEMENT DE COULEUR D'ENSEMBLE DE SERVICES DE BASE, ET SUPPORT DE STOCKAGE INFORMATIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND APPARATUS FOR PROCESSING BASIC SERVICE SET COLOR, AND COMPUTER STORAGE MEDIUM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed are a method and apparatus for processing a basic service set color, and a computer storage medium. The method comprises: determining a first physical protocol data unit, PPDU, under a first frequency band, wherein a physical header of the first PPDU carries a first BSS color; and determining a second physical protocol data unit, PPDU, under a second frequency band, wherein a physical header of the second PPDU carries a second BSS color; wherein the first BSS color is different from the second BSS color.</p>
            </abstract>
